{"name":"Bodacious","hex":"#b2619d","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bodacious","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Audacious and unrestrained.","Incorrigible and insolent."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Bodaciously."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bodacious"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bodacious (bull)","blocks":[{"text":"Bodacious #J-31 was an American bucking bull. He was known throughout the rodeo world as \"the world's most dangerous bull\". He was also known as \"the greatest bull ever to buck\". During his rodeo career, he was the 1994 and 1995 Professional Rodeo Cowboy Association (PRCA) Bucking Bull of the Year, as well as the 1995 PBR World Champion Bull. He and Bruiser are the only bulls who have won bucking bull world championship titles in both organizations."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/03/Bodacious_the_Bull.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bodacious_(bull)","wikidata":"Q4936375"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/03/Bodacious_the_Bull.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/03/Bodacious_the_Bull.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABodacious_the_Bull.jpg"}],"sounds":{"bodacious":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/EN-AU_ck1_bodacious.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/59/EN-AU_ck1_bodacious.ogg/EN-AU_ck1_bodacious.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"The Color Purple (63862099)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/The_Color_Purple_%2863862099%29.jpeg/500px-The_Color_Purple_%2863862099%29.jpeg","ratio":1.8920233463035019,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Color_Purple_(63862099).jpeg","share":0.04125}]}}